{
  "id": "PRO.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 5",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pay attention, my child, and listen to my wisdom and insight. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will know how to behave properly, and your words will show that you have knowledge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The lips of another man's wife may be as sweet as honey and her kisses as smooth as olive oil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but when it is all over, she leaves you nothing but bitterness and pain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She will take you down to the world of the dead; the road she walks is the road to death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She does not stay on the road to life; but wanders off, and does not realize what is happening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now listen to me, my children, and never forget what I am saying. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep away from such a woman! Don't even go near her door! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you do, others will gain the respect that you once had, and you will die young at the hands of merciless people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes, strangers will take all your wealth, and what you have worked for will belong to someone else. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will lie groaning on your deathbed, your flesh and muscles being eaten away, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and you will say, “Why would I never learn? Why would I never let anyone correct me? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I wouldn't listen to my teachers. I paid no attention to them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And suddenly I found myself",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "And suddenly",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "myself",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "I was about to be.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " publicly disgraced.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be faithful to your own wife and give your love to her alone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Children that you have by other women will do you no good. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your children should grow up to help you, not strangers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So be happy with your wife and find your joy with the woman you married — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pretty and graceful as a deer. Let her charms keep you happy; let her surround you with her love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why should you give your love to another woman, my son? Why should you prefer the charms of another man's wife? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sees everything you do. Wherever you go, he is watching. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sins of the wicked are a trap. They get caught in the net of their own sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They die because they have no self-control. Their utter stupidity will send them to their graves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PRO.6",
    "number": "6",
    "bookId": "PRO"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PRO.4",
    "number": "4",
    "bookId": "PRO"
  }
}